From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OKO build <oko@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] build: do not build gnulib self-tests

GnuTLS imports gnulib with --with-tests, so src/gl/tests is built even
with --disable-tests. Those tests include <signal.h> before <pthread.h>
and the vendor uClibc-ng headers (arm-rockchip830 toolchain) declare
pthread_t in bits/sigthread.h before pthread.h defines it, which fails
with:

  bits/sigthread.h: error: unknown type name 'pthread_t'

The self-tests are not needed for the target rootfs; skip the subdir.

Signed-off-by: OKO build <oko@localhost>
---
 src/gl/Makefile.am | 2 +-
 src/gl/Makefile.in | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/src/gl/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/gl/Makefile.am
@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@
 DISTCLEANFILES =
 MAINTAINERCLEANFILES =
 # No GNU Make output.
-SUBDIRS += . tests
+SUBDIRS += .
 EXTRA_DIST += m4/gnulib-cache.m4
 
 AM_CPPFLAGS =
--- a/src/gl/Makefile.in
+++ b/src/gl/Makefile.in
@@ -3974,7 +3974,7 @@
 unistringtests_libunistring_LTLIBOBJS = @unistringtests_libunistring_LTLIBOBJS@
 AUTOMAKE_OPTIONS = 1.14 gnits subdir-objects
 # No GNU Make output.
-SUBDIRS = . tests
+SUBDIRS = .
 TESTS_ENVIRONMENT = 
 noinst_HEADERS = 
 noinst_LIBRARIES = 
-- 
